# The documentation is a single-page app emitted into /docs. A static host has
# no server to rewrite its client-side routes, so a deep link such as
# /docs/quickstart must be handed back to the SPA's own index.html. Assets are
# matched first so they are served as themselves.
/docs/assets/*  /docs/assets/:splat  200
/docs/*         /docs/index.html     200

https://docs.effgen.org/* https://effgen.org/docs/:splat 301!
